{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15747","headline":"长林令衞象饧丝结歌 · 司空曙","name":"长林令衞象饧丝结歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人琱盘盘素丝，寒女眷眷墨子悲。\n乃言假使饧爲之，八珍重沓失颜色。\n手援玉筯不敢持，始状芙蓉新出水。\n仰坼重衣倾万蕊，又如合欢交乱枝。\n红茸向暮花参差，吴蚕络茧抽尚绝。\n细缕纤毫看欲灭，雪发羞垂倭堕鬟。\n绣囊畏并茱萸结，我爱此丝巧。\n妙绝世间无，爲君作歌陈座隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}